  "integrationCountClarification": "Earlier 13-test integration runs included checker.test.mjs, which compiles/runs the original JavaScript drivers/check.js and ignores TSC_TS_BIN. These 12 tests exercise the Go executable. Go parity separately reuses checker-cases.mjs across 80 cases per scheduler.",
  "watchFixes": [
    "Track symlink physical paths and cached target identity; invalidate all aliases for physical target or ancestor changes.",
    "Keep absolute directory watches at every depth, with nonrecursive nearest-existing-ancestor fallbacks.",
    "Invalidate cached missing config after project ancestor recreation; filter events against actual dependencies rather than broad fallback watch roots.",
    "Emit build watch readiness after installing watches, eliminating edits racing initial/fallback registration.",
    "Ignore stale termination callbacks after subscription replacement/removal.",
    "Suppress repeated deletion reports only when prior config resolution recorded actual file absence; retain invalid-existing-to-missing transitions.",
    "Linux PID observation helper reads children of every process thread, preserving worker-replacement assertions for Go."
  ],
